## 1. High-Level Game State Machine
We replace `GameManager` with a `GameStateMachine`. Because the transition to the garden happens in the **same scene**, the State Machine will manage turning features on/off without loading screens.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class GameStateMachine {
        - IGameState currentState
        + ChangeState(IGameState newState)
    }
    class IGameState {
        <<interface>>
        + Enter()
        + Tick()
        + Exit()
    }
    class Part1ApartmentState {
        - int currentLoop
        + HandleBedRecovery()
    }
    class Part2GardenState {
        + StartExploration()
        + StartSwimming()
    }

    GameStateMachine --> IGameState
    IGameState <|.. Part1ApartmentState
    IGameState <|.. Part2GardenState
```

